  "body": "# Release v0.23.3\r\n\r\nPython package release, other packages are unchanged\r\n\r\n:rotating_light: Fixs a breaking change introduced in v0.23.1  \r\n\r\n## What's changed\r\n\r\nPatch for the python package with three fixes:\r\n- Loosen the `huggingface_hub` requirements to allow `huggingface_hub` v2 https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers/pull/2486#issuecomment-6062880361 - Unblocks `transformers` installs\r\n- Fix type hints not resolving for pyright: https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers/issues/2456\r\n- Fix a breaking change from 0.23.1 regarding truncation and overflowing: https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers/issues/2091\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/huggingface/tokenizers/compare/v0.23.2...v0.23.3"
